#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/palo_alto.rst:87
msgid ""
"Palo Alto Networks uses a commit-based configuration model. Changes made "
"through |morpheus| are staged as candidate configuration and must be "
"committed to take effect:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/palo_alto.rst:89
msgid "Make desired changes to security rules, groups, or policies"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/palo_alto.rst:90
msgid "Review pending changes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/palo_alto.rst:91
msgid "Click :guilabel:`COMMIT` to apply changes to the running configuration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/palo_alto.rst:92
msgid "Alternatively, click :guilabel:`DISCARD` to abandon pending changes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/palo_alto.rst:94
msgid "Important"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/palo_alto.rst:94
msgid ""
"Uncommitted changes exist only in the candidate configuration. They do "
"not affect traffic until committed. Multiple changes can be batched into "
"a single commit operation."
msgstr ""

